Dear Busisiwe,

I hope you and everyone at Garden Route Guesthouse are well as we move towards summer.

Welcome to the October 2026 edition of the CloudDesk Mail customer newsletter. Thank you for being a valued customer.

Product news this month is all about making daily admin a little easier. We have tidied up the inbox search so you can find older bookings and guest messages faster, and we have added a new folders view that keeps newsletters separate from direct guest enquiries. There is also a small update to our spelling support for South African English.

Our seasonal tip for guesthouses is to prepare a simple summer information sheet for rooms. A short note on check in times, parking, breakfast hours and laundry arrangements helps guests settle in and often reduces routine questions at reception.

Please let me know if you have feedback on these updates, as your comments help guide what we improve next.

To unsubscribe from this newsletter, please reply to this email with Unsubscribe as the subject line and I will remove you from the list.

